                <pb facs="0170" n="77" sameAs="frus:frus1935v04/pg77"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.3415/4962: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-06-12T13:00:00-04:00">June 12, 1935—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:42 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>76. Peace pact signed Foreign Ministers of Bolivia and Paraguay and by members of
                    Mediation Commission as witnesses today at 12:45 p.m. Repeated to Asunción and
                    La Paz.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Weddell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
